  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic. Slice tomato into thin half-moons.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a small bowl.\n• Crumble in fetta cubes and mash to combine. Add yoghurt and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61fb5d9aa424b1719250d015/step-f2c4c1cc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook onion, until tender, 3-4 mins.\n• Cook chickpeas, remaining garlic, tomato paste, all-purpose seasoning, until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Cook vegetable stock, the water and a pinch of brown sugar until slightly thickened 1-2 mins.\n• Remove from heat. Stir in butter and lightly mash chickpeas until slightly broken up.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61fb5d9aa424b1719250d015/step-6a52c0d8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Add mixed salad leaves and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61fb5d9aa424b1719250d015/step-6429ee4a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate for 10 seconds bursts until warmed through.\n• Build tacos by filling tortillas with salad, tomato and chickpeas.\n• Top with garlic fetta yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61fb5d9aa424b1719250d015/step-be6ac32b.jpg"
    }
  ]
